                    File, Vietnam, Harvan Misc. &amp; Memos, Vol.
                    V(a), 7/68. Secret. The notation “ps” on the memorandum indicates that the
                    President saw it.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d317-f2" n="2" xml:id="d317-f2-content">
                <p>The Paris delegation’s reports on the 15th formal session are in telegrams
                        18798/Delto 531 and 18824/Delto 536 from Paris, both July 31. (Ibid.,
                        Harvan Chron., Vol. XVI, 7/26–31/68)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
